  "fcc_description": "<p>Given a 5x5 matrix representing the \"house\" at the end of a curling round, determine which team scores and how many points they score.</p>\n<p>The layout:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The center cell (index <code>[2, 2]</code>) is the \"button\".</li>\n<li>The 8 cells directly surrounding the button represent ring 1.</li>\n<li>And the 16 cells on the outer edge of the house represent ring 2.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In the given matrix:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>\".\"</code> represents an empty space.</li>\n<li><code>\"R\"</code> represents a space with a red stone.</li>\n<li><code>\"Y\"</code> represents a space with a yellow stone.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Scoring rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Only one team can score per round.</li>\n<li>The team with the stone closest to the button scores.</li>\n<li>The scoring team earns 1 point for each of their stones that is closer to the button than the opponent's closest stone.</li>\n<li>The lower the ring number, the closer to the center the stone is.</li>\n<li>If both teams' closest stone is the same distance from the center, no team scores.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Return:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A string in the format <code>\"team: number_of_points\"</code>. e.g: <code>\"R: 2\"</code>.</li>\n<li>or <code>\"No points awarded\"</code> if neither team scored any points.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For example, given:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\">[\n  [\".\", \".\", \"R\", \".\", \".\"],\n  [\".\", \"R\", \".\", \".\", \".\"],\n  [\"Y\", \".\", \".\", \".\", \".\"],\n  [\".\", \"R\", \".\", \".\", \".\"],\n  [\".\", \".\", \".\", \".\", \".\"]\n]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Return <code>\"R: 2\"</code>. The two red stones in ring 1 are tied for the closest and are the only two stones closer than yellows closest.</p>",
  "fcc_js_tests": "[{\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"R: 2\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"R: 2\\\");\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"Y: 3\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"Y: 3\\\");\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"No points awarded\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"No points awarded\\\");\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"R: 4\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"R: 4\\\");\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"Y: 1\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"]]), \\\"Y: 1\\\");\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>scoreCurling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"No points awarded\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"assert.equal(scoreCurling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"]]), \\\"No points awarded\\\");\"}]",
  "fcc_py_tests": "[{\"text\": \"<p><code>score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"R:2\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"({test: () => { runPython(`\\nfrom unittest import TestCase\\nTestCase().assertEqual(score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"R: 2\\\")`)\\n}})\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"Y: 3\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"({test: () => { runPython(`\\nfrom unittest import TestCase\\nTestCase().assertEqual(score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"Y: 3\\\")`)\\n}})\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"No points awarded\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"({test: () => { runPython(`\\nfrom unittest import TestCase\\nTestCase().assertEqual(score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"No points awarded\\\")`)\\n}})\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"R: 4\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"({test: () => { runPython(`\\nfrom unittest import TestCase\\nTestCase().assertEqual(score_curling([[\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\".\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\".\\\"], [\\\".\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\".\\\"]]), \\\"R: 4\\\")`)\\n}})\"}, {\"text\": \"<p><code>score_curling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"]])</code> should return <code>\\\"Y: 1\\\"</code>.</p>\", \"testString\": \"({test: () => { runPython(`\\nfrom unittest import TestCase\\nTestCase().assertEqual(score_curling([[\\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\\"], [\\\"Y\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"Y\\